content:
The chiefs of Edom will be terrified,
    the leaders of Moab will be seized with trembling,
  the people of Canaan will melt away;

the curtains of the courtyard with its posts and bases, and the curtain for the entrance to the courtyard;
    the ropes and tent pegs for the courtyard;
    all the furnishings for the tabernacle, the tent of meeting;
